Scapula Pull-up</h1><div class="page_subtitle">
Exercise / Back / Wing, Trapezius</div></div></div><div id="winner_page_body" class="page_body "><div class="theme_canvas"><div class="main_column"><article id="exercise-15660" class="wpt_exercise_single post-15660 winner_exercise type-winner_exercise status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry winner_exercise_pri_muscle-back winner_exercise_pri_muscle-trapezius winner_exercise_sec_muscle-trapezius winner_exercise_equipment-full-gym"><div class="exercise_content post_content copy"><h2><strong>How to do Scapula Pull-up</strong></h2><p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-15661 aligncenter" src="https://fitnessprogramer.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Scapula-Pull-up.gif" alt="Scapula Pull-up" width="360" height="360" /></p></div><aside class="exercise_specs"><div class="wrapper"><div class="spec_group thumbnail"><h3 class="group-title">
Preview</h3><div class="group-content exercise_thumbnail">
<a href="https://fitnessprogramer.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Scapula-Pull-up.gif">
<img src="https://fitnessprogramer.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/Scapula-Pull-up.gif" alt="Scapula Pull-up" />
</a></div></div><div class="spec_group muscle_groups"><h3 class="group-title">
